# Renovate logs
renovate.log
# GoReleaser build output. This must stay ignored: prune_backups reads its
# version from debug.ReadBuildInfo(), which the Go toolchain stamps from the
# VCS state - an untracked dist/ makes the tree dirty and the release binary
# then reports "v0.10.5+dirty" to users.
dist/
